Returns a sequence of all enumerations in the model,
sorted by enumeration name.

@param aModel A UML model
/]
[query public e_allEnumerations(
		aModel : uml::Model) : Sequence(uml::Enumeration) =
	aModel.eAllContents(uml::Enumeration)->sortedBy(e | e.name)
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of all packages in the model,
sorted by package name.

@param aModel A UML model
/]
[query public e_allPackages(
		aModel : uml::Model) : Sequence(uml::Package) =
	aModel.eAllContents(uml::Package)->sortedBy(p | p.name)
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of all abstraction client classes or data types in the model.

@param aModel A UML model
/]
[query public u_allAbstractionClients(
		aModel : uml::Model) : Sequence(uml::NamedElement) =
	aModel.eAllContents(uml::Abstraction)
		->collect(n | n.client)
		->filter({uml::Class | uml::DataType})
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of all abstraction supplier classes or data types in the model.

@param aModel A UML model
/]
[query public u_allAbstractionSuppliers(
		aModel : uml::Model) : Sequence(uml::NamedElement) =
	aModel.eAllContents(uml::Abstraction)
		->collect(n | n.supplier)
		->filter({uml::Class | uml::DataType})
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of all top-level super classes in a package,
sorted by class name.
Top-level super classes have no superclass themselves
but have at least one subclass.

@param aPackage A UML package
/]
[query public u_allTopSuperClasses(
		aPackage : uml::Package) : Sequence(uml::Class) =
	aPackage.eAllContents(uml::Class)
		->select(c | c.superClass->isEmpty())
		->select(c | c.u_subClasses()->notEmpty())
		->sortedBy(c | c.name)
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of association-end properties of a class.
Note: A simpler approach using eInverse(Association) may be possible.

@param aClass A UML class
/]
[query public e_associationProperties(
		aClass : uml::Class) : Sequence(uml::Property) =
	aClass.eContents(uml::Property)
		->select(temp12 | temp12.association <> null)
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of association-end properties from other packages
that reference the specified class.

@param aClass A UML class
/]
[query public e_associationsFromOtherPackages(
		aClass : uml::Class) : Sequence(uml::Property) =
	aClass.getModel().eAllContents(uml::Property)
		->select(temp13 | temp13.association <> null)
		->select(a | a.type.name = aClass.name)
		->select(a | a.type.package.name <> aClass.package.name)
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of association-end properties of a class
that point to classes in other packages.

@param aClass A UML class
/]
[query public e_associationsToOtherPackages(
		aClass : uml::Class) : Sequence(uml::Property) =
	aClass.eContents(uml::Property)
		->select(temp14 | temp14.association <> null)
		->select(a |
			a.association.memberEnd->first().type.package.name
				<> aClass.package.name)
/]

[**
Returns a sequence of owned attributes of a classifier,
sorted by attribute name.
Note: Intended for use with classes and data types only.

@param aClassifier A UML classifier
/]
[query public u_attributes(
		aClassifier : uml::Classifier) : Sequence(uml::Property) =
	aClassifier.eContents(uml::Property)
		->select(c | c.association = null)
		->sortedBy(c | c.name)
/]

